WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.236
-Kathryn, you are
an incredible actor,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.771
which means you're in touch with
many different emotions,

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.907
so I want to see just how
emotional we can get.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.210
It's time for
an Emotional Interview.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.047
-♪ Emotional Interview ♪

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:16.182
-Now, here's how it works.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.884
We'll have a normal conversation
with each other,

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.619
except every so often,
we're going to hear

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.721
this ding sound...
[ Ding ]

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.290
And when we hear that, we'll be
given an emotion or a situation

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.726
that we have to act out
as we keep talking.

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.361
Sound okay?

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.362
-Yes.
-Alright, good.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.964
Here we go.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.767
Let's just -- I'll start off
the conversation.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.969
Do you have any
big summer plans, maybe?

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.170
-Oh, yes.
[ Ding ]

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.540 line:0%
Huge ones. I --
-Oh, that sounds great!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.709 line:0%
Ooh, it's going to be so good.
-Right?!

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:48.614 line:0%
I love the beach, and I love
summer, and I love suntans.

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:51.350 line:0%
-I love summer, sun, sun,
anything with an "S",

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.052 line:0%
I love, love, love!
"S", "S", "S", "S"!

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:56.256 line:0%
-Anything with an "S"
is up my alley!

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.624 line:0%
-Anything with an "S" is --
-I'm with you.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.658 line:0%
And you know what?
You're the best, Jimmy.

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:01.527 line:0%
-No!
-You're the best.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.028 line:0%
-Well, you're probably looking
in the mirror,

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:04.630 line:0%
because you are the best.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.899 line:0%
[ Ding ]
That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:09.735 line:0%
-[ Laughs ] You're going to make
me cry right now.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:13.272 line:0%
I am literally -- I don't know
what to tell you.

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:17.409 line:0%
You know what's so relaxing?
Doing virtual interviews.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:21.380 line:0%
I love it. What I love about it
is technology,

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.083 line:0%
'cause I'm so good at it.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.419 line:0%
-Oh, I was --
No, I was --

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.320 line:0%
Sorry, I was, uh --

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.557 line:0%
I was listening to
what you were saying.

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.291 line:0%
-Oh. Oh, OK.

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.360 line:0%
Well, you're such a good
listener, Jimmy,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.096 line:0%
and you're a really --
make it easy on your guests.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.899 line:0%
-You know, I -- Well, I was
thinking about, you know,

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.467 line:0%
going to my -- because I live on
an island.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:44.370 line:0%
I have an island that I go to
with my wife.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.838 line:0%
She's from Canada.
You probably don't know her.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:46.772 line:0%
-You do?
[ Ding ]

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.140 line:0%
-Yeah.
-And I'm --

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.475 line:0%
-But, you know, hey,
it is what it is.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:51.344 line:0%
-Well, I hear you.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.412 line:0%
It is what it is.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.212 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:54.514 line:0%
-Hey, hey!

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.883 line:0%
It is what it is.
-Yeah, that's --

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.886 line:0%
Yeah, we -- Yeah, you know.
It is what it is.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.220 line:0%
-Hey, you know what's a great --

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.489 line:0%
You know what's a great TV show?
"The Sopranos".

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:04.890 line:0%
[ Imitating Tony Soprano ]
"Hey, it is what it is."

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.960 line:0%
-No, no, no, no, no.
No, I love the movie

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.195 line:0%
"GoodFellas", when he was like,

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.397 line:0%
[ Italian accent]
"Hey, it is what it is."

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.199 line:0%
-Oh, I know exactly.
When he's like this --

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:17.636 line:0%
Oh! I heard...

00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:19.939 line:0%
What I heard...

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:22.375 line:0%
about "GoodFellas".
-What?

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:25.644 line:0%
-Let me tell you something.
-Give me the hot.

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:27.847 line:0%
-Real scotch.
-Give me the hot.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.916 line:0%
-Real scotch in those glasses in
"GoodFellas".

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:32.285 line:0%
-Is that right?
-That wasn't just, you know...

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.686 line:0%
-I heard --
-...The flavored iced tea.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.388 line:0%
They were -- They were loaded
the whole time.

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:37.557 line:0%
That's what I heard.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.691 line:0%
-I heard they were --
-Don't tell anybody.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.026 line:0%
-I heard they were all
sleeping together.

00:02:41.026 --> 00:02:44.063 line:0%
-[ Gasps ]
-Joe Pesci and Robert De Niro.

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.399 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
-Pesci and De Niro?!

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:49.535 line:0%
-I don't know.
-Ooh, Pesci.

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:51.937 line:0%
-You know...
-Both: It is what it is.

00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:52.839 line:0%
[ Ding ]

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.041 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:58.010 line:0%
-I -- Oh.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.745 line:0%
-I got a new car.
-I heard you.

00:02:59.745 --> 00:03:01.180 line:0%
You told me.
-And it looks like the DeLorean.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.951 line:0%
-Oh, no, I -- My car talks to me
and tells me

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.220 line:0%
that I should speed up
or slow down.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.621 line:0%
I love it. It's so fun.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.256 line:0%
-Listen, I don't like to brag
about my car,

00:03:11.256 --> 00:03:13.526 line:0%
being from L.A. and everything,
but let me tell you something,

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:17.029 line:0%
the doors go like that
instead of like that.

00:03:17.029 --> 00:03:19.131 line:0%
-I put my -- My door has
facial recognition,

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:20.866 line:0%
So I put --
And the door comes up,

00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:23.936 line:0%
hits me in the face,
and I go, "Life is great."

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.505 line:0%
I just love it.
It's cool.

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:26.673 line:0%
Everyone should get into it.

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:29.642 line:0%
It's not that expensive.
It's only like, $300,000.

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
-You know what?
[ Ding ]

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.012 line:0%
Oh!

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.515 line:0%
♪ That's amazing news ♪

00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:39.786 line:0%
♪ About your... ♪

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:40.920 line:0%
-♪ Tesla! ♪

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:44.157 line:0%
-♪ Tesla! ♪

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:46.225 line:0%
-♪ That's amazing news ♪
[ Ding ]

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:48.361 line:0%
There you have it.
That was an Emotional Interview

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.629 line:0%
with Kathryn Hahn.

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:53.165
"WandaVision" is available
on Disney+.

00:03:53.165 --> 00:03:55.334
It is what it is!

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:56.702
-It is what it is!

00:03:56.702 --> 00:03:58.537
-I'll be right back with
John M. Chu.

00:03:58.537 --> 00:03:59.772
Everyone come on back.

